{
  "id": "ch04_s01_zhaoyang",
  "chapter": 4,
  "act": 4,
  "scene": "zhaoyang",
  "palette": "ink",
  "cast": [
    "wuze",
    "tangjian"
  ],
  "weightless": false,
  "leavesLetter": [],
  "purpose": "在已定身份下，由她自己决定名字或领回私物",
  "lines": [
    {
      "id": "ch04_s01_zhaoyang.l1",
      "who": "tiji",
      "kind": "aside",
      "text": "册命已经收起，案上另铺了一张纸。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch04_s01_zhaoyang.l2",
      "who": "narr",
      "kind": "aside",
      "text": "唐递来的纸留在案前，你将旧笔拿稳。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch04_s01_zhaoyang.l3",
      "who": "narr",
      "kind": "aside",
      "text": "交接后的第五日，殿门只开半边，冷气沿着席边进来。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch04_s01_zhaoyang.l4",
      "who": "tangjian",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "旧笔和私物都点清了。该收的是差牌，帕子仍是你的。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch04_s01_zhaoyang.l5",
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "那就一并还我。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch04_s01_zhaoyang.l6",
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "笔给我。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch04_s01_zhaoyang.l7",
      "who": "tangjian",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "好。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch04_s01_zhaoyang.l8",
      "who": "narr",
      "kind": "aside",
      "text": "你拢住笔杆，掌上裂口抵着木头，比入宫那日浅了些。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch04_s01_zhaoyang.l9",
      "who": "tangjian",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "名字你亲口说，这页不替你写想要什么。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch04_s01_zhaoyang.l10",
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "我想……"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch04_s01_zhaoyang.l11",
      "who": "tangjian",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "嗯。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch04_s01_zhaoyang.l12",
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "这一页——"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch04_s01_zhaoyang.l13",
      "who": "tangjian",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "也不替旁人答应。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch04_s01_zhaoyang.l14",
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "是。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch04_s01_zhaoyang.l15",
      "when": {
        "flag.enthroned": true
      },
      "who": "tangjian",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "受位已成。你要不要用新名，昨日还没填。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch04_s01_zhaoyang.l16",
      "when": {
        "flag.enthroned": true
      },
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "再看一眼。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch04_s01_zhaoyang.l17",
      "when": {
        "flag.enthroned": true
      },
      "who": "narr",
      "kind": "aside",
      "text": "你蘸过笔，没有立刻落到册上。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch04_s01_zhaoyang.l18",
      "when": {
        "flag.enthroned": true
      },
      "who": "self",
      "kind": "inner",
      "text": "（天。也可以是曌。还可以……就留着。）"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch04_s01_zhaoyang.l19",
      "when": {
        "flag.enthroned": true
      },
      "who": "tangjian",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "怎么写，都照你这一笔。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch04_s01_zhaoyang.l20",
      "when": {
        "flag.enthroned": true
      },
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "我自己来写。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch04_s01_zhaoyang.l21",
      "when": {
        "flag.declined_crown": true
      },
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "名字没待补，东西领回就好。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch04_s01_zhaoyang.l22",
      "when": {
        "flag.declined_crown": true
      },
      "who": "tangjian",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "好。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch04_s01_zhaoyang.l23",
      "when": {
        "flag.declined_crown": true
      },
      "who": "tangjian",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "今日有公议。去听一听，不等于你答应接差事。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch04_s01_zhaoyang.l24",
      "when": {
        "flag.liqinghe_won": true
      },
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "要议的文书给我，我仍署自己的名。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch04_s01_zhaoyang.l25",
      "when": {
        "flag.liqinghe_won": true
      },
      "who": "tangjian",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "你写的，就记你的名。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch04_s01_zhaoyang.l26",
      "when": {
        "flag.liqinghe_won": true
      },
      "who": "tangjian",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "留给你的那份在这，没同授位的册子装一起。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch04_s01_zhaoyang.l27",
      "who": "empty",
      "kind": "aside",
      "text": "旧景·八月望夜。满月照进窗，案上酒盏投下一弯黑影。",
      "image": "wu_yuejiu"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch04_s01_zhaoyang.l28",
      "who": "narr",
      "kind": "aside",
      "text": "眼前，你把素帕压回袖底，留笔在手里。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch04_s01_zhaoyang.l29",
      "who": "narr",
      "kind": "aside",
      "text": "你从私物里取出旧诗笺，指腹抚开折痕。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch04_s01_zhaoyang.l30",
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "poem",
      "text": "空卷珠帘不曾下，长移一榻对山眠。",
      "poem": "yuxuanji_tiyinwuting"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch04_s01_zhaoyang.l31",
      "who": "self",
      "kind": "inner",
      "text": "（我也想有半日，谁都不来催。）"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch04_s01_zhaoyang.l32",
      "who": "narr",
      "kind": "aside",
      "text": "你把诗笺折回原样，抬眼看案上等着落笔的纸。"
    }
  ],
  "choices": [
